Maintainer: AntiCitoyen <anticitoyen@users.noreply.gitlab.com>
Homepage: https://gitlab.com/anticitoyen/Anticitoyen-ROG-flare2-anime-matrix
Description: AniMe Matrix display tools for the ASUS ROG Strix Flare II Animate
 Linux tools for the 312-LED AniMe Matrix display of the ASUS ROG Strix
 Flare II Animate keyboard (USB 0b05:19fc), without Armoury Crate:
  - graphical launcher with 4 layouts (round dial + drawer, dial, rounded,
    classic tabs), 11 themes, 19 languages: GIF/images, folder gallery,
    clock, drawing editor;
  - 19 animated effects and 7 audio visualizers (engine from PolyWollyWin);
  - GIF conversion tuned for the LED matrix (ImageMagick);
  - background gallery or clock as systemd user services, one-click toggle;
  - udev rule giving the logged-in user access to the keyboard.
 Support the project: https://fr.tipeee.com/anticitoyen/ or
